    "body": "In common American Mah Jongg play, valid winning hands are defined by a card updated each year. Always use the same current card as the rest of your table."
  },
  {
    "heading": "Charleston tile passing",
    "body": "The Charleston is a series of tile exchanges before normal play. The sequence and optional passes should follow the rules adopted by your group."
  },
  {
    "heading": "Jokers have limits",
